   "end_sec": 12.191,
   "duration_sec": 5.542
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C49-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "私はパソコンにします。この献立の「澄まし汁」は、味が薄い汁ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C49-D003-S01",
    "C49-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 12.541,
   "end_sec": 18.184,
   "duration_sec": 5.643
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C49-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "濃いか薄いかではなくて、濁っていない汁です。食材の香りも楽しめます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C49-D004-S01",
    "C49-D004-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 18.534,
   "end_sec": 24.255,
   "duration_sec": 5.721
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C49-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "食器を選ぶカードもありますね。豆入りの料理は、この皿に盛り付けるんですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C49-D005-S01",
    "C49-D005-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 24.605,
   "end_sec": 30.444,
   "duration_sec": 5.839
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C49-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "そのとおりです。粒が見える図です。肉類と野菜は一緒に盛り合わせる例もあります。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C49-D006-S01",
    "C49-D006-S02",
    "C49-D006-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 30.794,
   "end_sec": 37.64,
   "duration_sec": 6.846
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C49-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "佐藤",
   "source_text": "「油を注ぐ」の次は「熱する」ですね。サラダオイルで揚げる料理でしょうか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C49-D007-S01",
    "C49-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-10",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 37.99,
   "end_sec": 43.764,
   "duration_sec": 5.774
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C49-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "ええ。別のカードでは、液が沸騰したら火加減を変えて煮込みます。味付けの説明は裏です。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C49-D008-S01",
    "C49-D008-S02",
    "C49-D008-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-5",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
