   ],
   "start_sec": 44.114,
   "end_sec": 51.928,
   "duration_sec": 7.814
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C49-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "ミン",
   "source_text": "一切れの大きさまで書いてあります。加工の方法で歯ざわりも変わるんですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C49-D009-S01",
    "C49-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-podcaster-11",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 52.278,
   "end_sec": 57.688,
   "duration_sec": 5.41
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C49-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "アナ",
   "source_text": "はい。ただ、これは説明を読む教材です。実際に作るときは料理ごとの詳しい説明が必要です。",
